            Input: 3,000V&#9107;??A, 131W<br>
            Output: 71W, &infin;W
            <p style="display: none; font-size: 0.5em;">
                1 kcal/day = 0.01157407407 cal/sec<br>
                1 cal/sec = 4.184 J/sec<br>
                <br>
                input<br>
                daily energy requirements for 26yo 81kg female = 2700kcal. (https://www.eatforhealth.gov.au/nutrition-calculators/daily-energy-requirements-calculator)<br>
                2700 kcal/day<br>
                112.5 kcal/hr<br>
                0.03125 kcal/sec<br>
                31.25 cal/sec<br>
                130.75 J/sec<br>
                131 W<br>
                <br>
                output<br>
                harper's basal metabolic rate @ 2026/08/27 = 1464 kcal.<br>
                1464 kcal/day<br>
                61 kcal/hr<br>
                0.01694 kcal/sec<br>
                16.94 cal/sec<br>
                70.88 J/sec<br>
                71 W<br>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mark-container">
            <img src="/img/ce-mark_210x150.png" class="icon32 inverted" alt="CE mark">
            {# <img src="/img/UKCA_filled.svg" class="icon32 inverted" alt="UK Conformity Assessed"> #}
            <img src="/img/RCM_0.png" class="icon32 inverted" alt="Regulatory Compliance Mark">
            <img src="/img/WEEE_symbol.svg" class="icon32 inverted" alt="WEEE mark">
        </div>
        
        <div class="origin-container">
